  "keyFeatures": [
    "Crew discovery — search and connect with filmmakers, directors, cinematographers, and other film professionals",
    "Location scouting — browse and list filming locations with photos, availability, and pricing",
    "Equipment marketplace — find and rent cameras, lighting, audio, and other production equipment",
    "Opportunity board — post and apply for film production roles, gigs, and projects",
    "Filmmaker profiles — showcase portfolio, credits, skills, and availability",
    "Messaging and collaboration — communicate directly with crew members and location owners",
    "Reviews and ratings — build reputation through verified reviews from past collaborations"
